{"id":"54bb395d-3e60-4c94-b525-85523901575b","revision":0,"last_node_id":482,"last_link_id":739,"nodes":[{"id":476,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-840,2410],"size":[420,620],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note: Model links","properties":{},"widgets_values":["Guide: [Subgraph](http<local_path> Input Assets\n\n- [portrait_model_denim.png](http<local_path> [clothing_light_blue_denim_shirt.png](http<local_path> Model Links\n\n- [Hugging Face:Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1](http<local_path> [ModelScope:Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1](http<local_path>**diffusion_models**\n\n- [qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors](http<local_path> [qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors](http<local_path>**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors](http<local_path> [qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors](http<local_path> \n\n**vae**\n\n- [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](http<local_path> Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├── qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors\n│   │   └── qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   ├── qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors\n│   │   └── qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│       └── qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](http<local_path> and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](http<local_path> UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](http<local_path> Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](http<local_path>"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"Guide: [Subgraph](http<local_path> Input Assets\n\n- [portrait_model_denim.png](http<local_path> [clothing_light_blue_denim_shirt.png](http<local_path> Model Links\n\n- [Hugging Face:Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1](http<local_path> [ModelScope:Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1](http<local_path>**d